type: software
title: "AI & Machine Learning Course — Jupyter Notebooks & Materials"
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive collection of Jupyter Notebooks covering
  Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Advanced Deep Learning
  topics. Includes Python for ML foundations, classical ML
  algorithms (SVM, KNN, Random Forest, Naive Bayes), PyTorch
  deep learning pipelines, CNNs, NLP, and a capstone project
  on Bangladesh student performance prediction.
